 {"tacticSucceeded": false,
  "startLine": 91,
  "startCol": 2,
  "shortenedStepsCount": 0,
  "parentName": "SL2.closure_elementary_eq_top",
  "oldText":
  "have step : ∀ (M : Matrix.SpecialLinearGroup (Fin 2) F), M.1 1 0 ≠ 0 → M ∈ H := by\n    intro M hM\n    have eq_M : M = SL2.E12 F ((M.1 0 0 - 1) / M.1 1 0) * SL2.E21 F (M.1 1 0) *\n        SL2.E12 F ((M.1 1 1 - 1) / M.1 1 0) := by\n      ext i j\n      match i, j with\n      | 0, 0 =>\n        simp only [Matrix.SpecialLinearGroup.coe_mul, Matrix.mul_apply, Fin.sum_univ_two,\n          Matrix.of_apply, Matrix.cons_val', Matrix.cons_val_zero, Matrix.cons_val_one, mul_zero,\n          mul_one, one_mul, add_zero, zero_add, SL2.E12, SL2.E21]\n        rw [div_mul_cancel₀ _ hM]\n        ring\n      | 0, 1 =>\n        simp only [Matrix.SpecialLinearGroup.coe_mul, Matrix.mul_apply, Fin.sum_univ_two,\n          Matrix.of_apply, Matrix.cons_val', Matrix.cons_val_zero, Matrix.cons_val_one, mul_one,\n          one_mul, zero_add, SL2.E12, SL2.E21]\n        rw [div_mul_cancel₀ _ hM, ← mul_div_assoc, ← add_div]\n        rw [show (1 + (M.1 0 0 - 1)) * (M.1 1 1 - 1) + (M.1 0 0 - 1) = M.1 0 1 * M.1 1 0 by\n          have hd := M.property\n          rw [Matrix.det_fin_two] at hd\n          calc (1 + (M.1 0 0 - 1)) * (M.1 1 1 - 1) + (M.1 0 0 - 1)\n              = M.1 0 0 * M.1 1 1 - 1 := by ring\n            _ = M.1 0 0 * M.1 1 1 - (M.1 0 0 * M.1 1 1 - M.1 0 1 * M.1 1 0) := by rw [hd]\n            _ = M.1 0 1 * M.1 1 0 := by ring]\n        rw [mul_div_cancel_right₀ _ hM]\n      | 1, 0 =>\n        simp only [Matrix.SpecialLinearGroup.coe_mul, Matrix.mul_apply, Fin.sum_univ_two,\n          Matrix.of_apply, Matrix.cons_val', Matrix.cons_val_zero, Matrix.cons_val_one, mul_zero,\n          zero_mul, mul_one, one_mul, add_zero, zero_add, SL2.E12, SL2.E21]\n      | 1, 1 =>\n        simp only [Matrix.SpecialLinearGroup.coe_mul, Matrix.mul_apply, Fin.sum_univ_two,\n          Matrix.of_apply, Matrix.cons_val', Matrix.cons_val_zero, Matrix.cons_val_one, zero_mul,\n          mul_one, one_mul, zero_add, SL2.E12, SL2.E21]\n        rw [mul_comm (M.1 1 0) ((M.1 1 1 - 1) / M.1 1 0), div_mul_cancel₀ _ hM]\n        ring\n    rw [eq_M]\n    exact Subgroup.mul_mem _ (Subgroup.mul_mem _ (h12 _) (h21 _)) (h12 _)",
  "message": null,
  "goalIsProp": true,
  "filepath": "/data/FLT/FLT/Slop/PGL2/FiniteSubgroups/PSLBasic.lean"},
